  (text "Energy measurement: INA219 in series with the node's 5 V supply (high side)." (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a1665f94-a062-4e6a-afc3-5a977a8888a7"))
  (text "The node under test is powered ONLY through the INA219 (VIN+ to VIN-). Do not also power it from its own USB." (at 25.4 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "90107ca4-bad0-415e-bce6-8108aa4b900a"))
  (text "R1 and R2 (4.7k I2C pull-ups to 3V3): fit only if the INA219 module has no pull-ups of its own." (at 25.4 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8c2b0018-ab92-44c1-9fd2-84e4d322e42b"))
  (text "All GND pins share one net. The monitor ESP32 supplies 3V3 for the INA219 logic and reads it over I2C (GPIO21 SDA, GPIO22 SCL)." (at 25.4 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e9f11d33-a03f-4645-96c7-1a546da5dca6"))
  (text "INA219 converts about every 0.5 ms: average energy over many update cycles, do not trust single short bursts." (at 25.4 46.99 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6357d6e8-0016-4bce-b970-a2c0b8ffc0c7"))
  (text "Check every pin against your module's datasheet before powering it. This schematic has not been built or tested." (at 25.4 52.07 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3136a824-d606-4d17-9b3d-1046c06fd073"))

